  lines:
  - slot: laughs
    text: Ha! That's the best you got? I've heard harder bars at a bus stop.
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd0b9ef4926eec341abd73abd5308b52, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: d3a7c1c6f7c884844851ea98567fba0c, type: 3}
  - slot: shrugs
    text: Whatever, man. I don't even know why you showed up tonight.
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab50fec7259c9bc929c9ca903bdcb734, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: d7025d720057e13119e40f7195507b2f, type: 3}
  - slot: nods
    text: Okay, okay. I see you. That one was clean, I'll give you that.
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c50073c4d9f9f5ab680846b2f15247d7, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 3b2ddb74f407c1512b23d38731e76b5e, type: 3}
  - slot: winces
    text: Oof. Alright. That one stung a little, not gonna lie.
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c3b4da3cf08c1479a2b48b4b787a8ca, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: d0ff5b981da305fcd83ff30c8ca6fbc1, type: 3}
  - slot: glares
    text: Say that again. Go on. Say it to my face.
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fac6b6cf8b470b9f88f4c7d7fc1ddc1b, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 4bcbf533341c4d3aaac39adc44ccf123, type: 3}
  - slot: steps_back
    text: Whoa, whoa, back up. Where'd that even come from?
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a4b4bc1bae5c7b29ad1c5b6fee38731, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: d4dd4661d8e7b0c6b8e7693ffda8a0c2, type: 3}
  - slot: rapping
    text: Check the mic, one two, I'm the king of this stage, you're a page I'ma
      tear, then I'm turning the page.
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a8214514cbb9a7fda6f36965946d6bc, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 2a9a0daa55330936b9fdea8e7eb03fa3, type: 3}
  - slot: rapping
    text: Step in my lane and you're stuck in reverse, I'm a curse on your name and
      I'm saving the worst.
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0ea44f6c2cb7a5e62908c028428ee628, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 2614577d3d7b8bd6794fe1b1da277fbb, type: 3}
  - slot: hype
    text: Yeah! Let's go! Make some noise for your champion!
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2942f26e2f7a67a38bfc8c06e0c1c081, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 3c119a6efb2e09b5f83fc7dbc4306a84, type: 3}
  fade: 0.25
